                                             "tier":  2,
                                             "riskNote":  "Removes the Win+G overlay. Some games use it for FPS counters, screenshots, and clip capture. It also removes the game-chat speech-to-text overlay, an accessibility feature that transcribes voice chat. The ms-gamebar, ms-gamebarservices, and ms-gamingoverlay links are pointed at a do-nothing stub so nothing asks for an app to open them; reinstalling Game Bar later needs this run undone as well, or those links stay inert."
                                         },
